  "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"content-panel studio-page\">\n                    <section class=\"studio-intro studio-section\">\n                        <div class=\"studio-copy\">\n                            <p class=\"eyebrow\">User journey measurement</p>\n                            <h2>Measure, understand and improve your digital services</h2>\n                            <p>Run user journey measurements on devices on our mobile\n                                test bench. Choose the device, system and network according to your goals, then\n                                analyse results at full journey or step-by-step level.</p>\n                            <p>Quickly identify overconsumption hotspots, performance issues and\n                                steps that deserve priority improvement.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                            <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/entete_studio_31ac4415.svg\" alt=\"Greenspector Studio overview\">\n                        </figure>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <div class=\"studio-copy\">\n                            <p class=\"eyebrow\">New KPIs</p>\n                            <h2>Environmental indicators and a truly representative ecoscore</h2>\n                            <p>The Greenspector ecoscore is based on a complete analysis of the user journey,\n                                taking into account the relative weight of measured steps and whether they are critical. It\n                                provides a reliable reading of your digital product's frugality level.</p>\n                            <p>With Greenspector Studio, also obtain a rigorous assessment of carbon\n                                impact and other environmental indicators directly usable by your\n                                teams.</p>\n                            <p><a href=\"../mesure-impact-environnemental-numerique/\">Learn more about\n                                    environmental impacts</a></p>\n                        </div>\n                        <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                            <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Greenspector-Studio-Ecoscore-r3tmosfu8yqrw3ak5b8noo6ypd23wbpp1qnna0qh14_fdbe25f9.png\" alt=\"Greenspector Studio ecoscore visualisation\">\n                        </figure>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">4-step journey</p>\n                        <h2>A simple workflow to manage frugality and performance</h2>\n                        <div class=\"studio-grid studio-steps\">\n                            <article class=\"studio-card\">\n                                <span class=\"studio-step-index\">1</span>\n                                <h3>Prepare tests</h3>\n                                <p>Describe a user journey with TestBuilder and our GDSL language.\n                                    The editor lets you quickly reproduce Android, iOS and Web journeys with\n                                    simple commands, screenshots and ready-to-use templates.</p>\n                                <p>A single tool lets you prepare tests, run them and compare results.</p>\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/ScriptGDSL-rnqpg1fgul47nbs0d4uarck0is9nkrfa3werw2g51y_63db4caf.png\" alt=\"Greenspector StepBuilder interface\">\n                            </article>\n                            <article class=\"studio-card\">\n                                <span class=\"studio-step-index\">2</span>\n                                <h3>Run measurements on the right device</h3>\n                                <p>Select a device from the test bench that matches your goals: a recent\n                                    model for current measurements, an older model to verify real journey\n                                    accessibility, or a specific network quality to test robustness.</p>\n                                <p>For business applications, you can also add devices from\n                                    your mobile fleet as an option.</p>\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/TestBench_FR-r5ydm7qvcdeudu7oxaf6kf2bj6mz7xk1xvwrescvy0_c76a775e.png\" alt=\"Device selection in the Greenspector test bench\">\n                            </article>\n                            <article class=\"studio-card\">\n                                <span class=\"studio-step-index\">3</span>\n                                <h3>Analyse step by step</h3>\n                                <p>Review the dashboard to spot steps that degrade frugality or\n                                    performance: energy overconsumption, response time, network dependencies,\n                                    third-party services or technical anomalies.</p>\n                                <p>Functional groupings and different reading levels make work easier for\n                                    the whole team.</p>\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/evolution-r41o1fvo92cqjsiy7yt7o2e2r6pln13h7djzozv2d4_4627dddb.png\" alt=\"Tracking indicator trends in Greenspector Studio\">\n                            </article>\n                            <article class=\"studio-card\">\n                                <span class=\"studio-step-index\">4</span>\n                                <h3>Improve continuously</h3>\n                                <p>Run a measurement before each release to detect anomalies as early as possible and\n                                    track indicator trends. APIs let you trigger tests\n                                    from your CI/CD pipelines and export results to your dashboards.</p>\n                                <p><a href=\"../devgreenops/\">Learn more about continuous integration</a></p>\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Interface_Benchmark-r66td0puroc334sscf31jk3w8kdl40z2c57wlx7pa0_df0faaae.png\" alt=\"Benchmark and indicators in Greenspector Studio\">\n                            </article>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section studio-highlight\">\n                        <div class=\"studio-copy\">\n                            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Overview</p>\n                            <h2>A first level of analysis for your entire application portfolio</h2>\n                            <p>Not all teams have the same maturity level or available time.\n                                With the integrated BenchMark test, get a score and carbon impact in one click for\n                                a web page or mobile application, without disrupting product teams.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                            <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Greenspector-Studio-metriques-danalyse-1024x567_88f7f4ba.png\" alt=\"Greenspector Studio analysis metrics view\">\n                        </figure>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section studio-highlight\">\n                        <div class=\"studio-copy\">\n                            <p class=\"eyebrow\">For tech leads</p>\n                            <h2>Fine-grained metrics to understand software behaviour</h2>\n                            <p>Analyse energy, inbound and outbound data, CPU, memory and\n                                Android system metrics to go beyond impressions. Direct,\n                                ultra-precise battery consumption measurement provides a concrete view of\n                                your application's behaviour.</p>\n                            <p><a href=\"../../contact/\">Request a free demo</a></p>\n                        </div>\n                        <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                            <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Interface_Energie-par-etape-r63byp63s0kjum3ot2ueiqc9paw1fjflobxqd6n4jc_7e2fbfe9.png\" alt=\"Battery discharge by step in Greenspector Studio\">\n                        </figure>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section studio-quote-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">What they say</p>\n                        <blockquote class=\"studio-quote\">\n                            <p>Working on frugality clearly leads to a more performant application.</p>\n                            <footer>\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/JAzria-150x150_fe3bb536.jpg\" alt=\"Portrait of Julien Azria\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <strong>Julien Azria</strong>\n                                    <span>Digital Front Chapter Leader, Crédit Agricole Technologies &amp; Services</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </footer>\n                        </blockquote>\n                        <p class=\"studio-footnote\"><em>Some features described may not be\n                                available depending on subscription level. Please refer to our <a href=\"../../tarifs-greenspector-studio/\">Pricing</a>.</em></p>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Standards</p>\n                        <h2>Compatible with leading industry frameworks</h2>\n                        <div class=\"studio-grid studio-mini-grid\">\n                            <article class=\"studio-card studio-card-compact\">\n                                <h3>Recognition</h3>\n                                <p>Solution recognised among efficient initiatives to protect the environment,\n                                    with an approach based on real use cases.</p>\n                            </article>\n                            <article class=\"studio-card studio-card-compact\">\n                                <h3>R&amp;D</h3>\n                                <p>Greenspector innovations are the result of research work and ongoing\n                                    contribution to international articles and conferences.</p>\n                            </article>\n                            <article class=\"studio-card studio-card-compact\">\n                                <h3>Methodological compatibility</h3>\n                                <p>The impact model is compatible with industry standards: ISO 14040 LCA,\n                                    Green Software Foundation SCI, ADEME RCP and other sector references.</p>\n                            </article>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">References</p>\n                        <h2>They use Greenspector Studio</h2>\n                        <p>To combine environmental responsibility, user satisfaction and application\n                            performance.</p>\n                        <div class=\"studio-logo-grid\">\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_sncfconnect_04f4832d.jpg\" alt=\"SNCF Connect logo\">\n                            </figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_cats_8cc5042d.jpg\" alt=\"CATS logo\">\n                            </figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Logo_AirFrance_616731c4.webp\" alt=\"Air France logo\">\n                            </figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/logo-bouygues-telecom_889990d1.svg\" alt=\"Bouygues Telecom logo\">\n                            </figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_orange_338b842b.jpg\" alt=\"Orange logo\">\n                            </figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Logo-France-televisions-300x157_e988d666.jpg\" alt=\"France Télévisions logo\">\n                            </figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_regionbretagne_b8829f76.jpg\" alt=\"Région Bretagne logo\">\n                            </figure>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                </div>"
}
